  "accountFaqAccuracyQ": "How accurate is my kitchen?",
  "accountFaqAccuracyA": "Items from receipts you reviewed are confirmed. Amounts after cooking are deducted from what you confirm. Anything estimated is labelled, and Chefii occasionally asks you to verify.",
  "accountFaqUntrackedQ": "What if I use something without telling Chefii?",
  "accountFaqUntrackedA": "Use the \"I used…\" button or tap − on an item. If counts drift, Quick check lets you fix several items in seconds.",
  "accountFaqFreshnessQ": "Are freshness dates safe to rely on?",
  "accountFaqFreshnessA": "No — they're estimates from typical storage times. Always follow the package date and your own judgement.",
  "accountFaqMedicalQ": "Does Chefii give medical advice?",
  "accountFaqMedicalA": "No. Nutrition features are education. For personal advice, share your records with a registered dietitian in My nutrition circle.",
  "accountFaqHealthDataQ": "Who can see my health data?",
  "accountFaqHealthDataA": "Only you, plus any professional you explicitly share with, for the time you choose. Household members never see your journal or health records.",
